Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:56.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}The Second
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:56.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Second
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is his arm okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he took a single step back, his\Narm would have been ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he wasn't thinking\Nabout how animal fangs work;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that'd require a tiny bit of brain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think Big Bro\NLuffy's arm will make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, a shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So wait, you an under?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His abilities double in\Nstrength when he's underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once my momentum in the water builds\Nup, it's impossible to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is precisely the kind of ability that\Nmakes us fishmen all the more superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.21,0:03:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A torpedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just flew out of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you could\Ndodge that. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the longer you evade your\Ndeath, the more painful it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shark... DOGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what kind of bones\Ndoes that crazy shark have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His nose crushed the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marlon went into the sea again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Big Bro, you\Ngotta hide from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's setting his sights on you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go run for cover before you\Nbecome a target. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not running anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.59,0:05:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna catch him and break his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ya shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you realize that it's\Npointless to try and hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear us telling you that\Nyou should go somewhere and hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You barely escaped his last attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he lands just one\Ndirect hit, it'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SHIELD!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey wait, what's that position?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll stop the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get double the\Nspeed from this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time I'll pierce your heart, Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SHOTTERS!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he get hit? He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He somehow managed to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack won't work now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.81,0:07:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just pure luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paper nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see the intensity in his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's the same expression that\Nsea kings make before they snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have snapped\Nwith Luffy's last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wretched human!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mighty fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't actually hurt, but I can\Ntell he's really, like, madder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The saw blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:08:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah! Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Micro Luffy! Micro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy will get cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah! Aaaaaah! Aaaaaah! Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He jumped in the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the left window on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the room that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nowhere else to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and me here in the highest\Nlevel of our long park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lot of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this isn't just any room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the room where I make Nami\Ndraw all of her C-charts for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nap room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:09:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Nami's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These C-charts are what she's\Nworked on all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no one else on\Nthe face of the planet that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can draw C-charts with such\Naccuracy and efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That young lady has a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there really isn't anything as ultimately\Nregrettable as wasting natural talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying here and drawing\Nup C-Charts for me is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.41,0:10:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her only chance at living\Nup to her full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pen is stained with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for me to attain world supremacy,\Nher C-Charts are absolutely vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will continue drawing her\NC-Charts for my own ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once her charts give me full\Nknowledge of all the world's oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fishmen will be totally invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the world shall kneel before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first step is this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll move on to the whole East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could never use her like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would be wasted on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shark cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, big bro Luffy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we knew what was going on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you take her for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:12:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's an inferior creature, but\Nshe has risen far above her peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all other humans are sewer rats,\Nthen she's a feisty little kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, she is adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has her place, and\Nit's here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can give her everything she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the only thing she has to do is continue\Ndrawing those marvelous charts for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Nami will forever be my tool or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a desk. Man. I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that was big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that\Nkind of talk from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your faith? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:12:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were scared too. Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just uh well you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were scared. Admit. Admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you jerk. Admit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Arlong's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that big bro Luffy\Nis going to lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is all that stuff\Nbeing thrown out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, as of today,\Nthis will be your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your desk, your pens, everything\Nyou'll need is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb rat, you can't trick me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to draw up fake charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you waste your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drawing crap like this in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever try to pull\Na stunt like this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drag all those villagers in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make you watch as I\Ncrush every single one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's eight years worth of work,\Neight years of planning and ambition!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fell in here, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this fight is so freaking intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a fight to the death, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've got too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.57,0:15:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep jabbering on about\Nhow much better fish men are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how much you need those sea charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nanything about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally figured out how to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room isn't anything\Nbut our jail cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way for Nami to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to tear this place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park cannot be brought\Ndown by some inferior human,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially not by some\Nrubbery freak like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start to drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.11,0:16:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Arlong Park is coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run for cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sense! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sense! We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:17:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roofing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wonder what went on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.19,0:18:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta know who won?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that debris!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just standing there. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:18:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU 'LL ALWAYS BE MY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm done, I'll keep you near.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I drift away, I pray you'll\Nwatch me as I disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:20:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watch the sunrise, I begin to wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason\Nit's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them to come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause they're everything I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.23,0:20:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrap these arms around my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands for you,\NI'm sure that we can make a way?

